{"seq":2,"slug":"active-frames","title":"起手/判定/收招帧：近战的时间语法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-melee-combat-systems/hitreg/active-frames","wordCount":1608,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"起手-判定-收招帧-近战的时间语法\">起手/判定/收招帧：近战的时间语法</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一次攻击在时间轴上被切成三段：<strong>起手帧</strong>（预备、给出读招窗口）、<strong>判定帧</strong>（攻击框激活、可命中）、<strong>收招帧</strong>（后摇、决定能否及何时接下一招）。三者都是可逐帧设计的资源，一帧之差即可改变手感；而命中之后&quot;谁先能动&quot;由<strong>帧优势</strong>（帧数据表算出的可行动差）决定，这是近战博弈的核心量。本篇是全 hub 帧数据的主讲篇。</p>\n<p><a href=\"../foundations/combat-model\">战斗模型</a> 已经把一次攻击拆成起手、判定、收招三段。本篇是把这三段的每一帧当成可设计的资源，讲清楚一帧之差如何改变手感，以及命中之后&quot;谁先能动&quot;这个决定近战博弈的量——帧优势——是怎么算出来的。格斗游戏把这套东西做到了极致，它们的招式表本质上就是一张帧数据表（参考 SuperCombo Wiki 对街霸6 的帧数据整理，<a href=\"https://wiki.supercombo.gg/w/Street_Fighter_6/Game_Data）。\">https://wiki.supercombo.gg/w/Street_Fighter_6/Game_Data）。</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"三段的设计含义\">三段的设计含义</h2><p>三段各自是一个独立的设计旋钮，改动同一段会拨动不同的手感维度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>段</th>\n<th>攻击框状态</th>\n<th>主要影响</th>\n<th>调大它会怎样</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>起手 startup</td>\n<td>关闭</td>\n<td>攻击的&quot;快慢&quot;、能否被反应</td>\n<td>更容易被读招躲开，但可作重攻的代价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>判定 active</td>\n<td>开启</td>\n<td>命中的&quot;宽容度&quot;、能否打到位移中的敌人</td>\n<td>更好蹭中，但过长会显得&quot;糊&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收招 recovery</td>\n<td>关闭</td>\n<td>打空的风险、能否连招</td>\n<td>打空惩罚更重，连招更难接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>起手是读招支柱的物理载体，<a href=\"../foundations/melee-pillars\">近战三支柱</a> 里算过普通玩家反应窗口约 12 帧，起手短于此的攻击&quot;看到再躲&quot;来不及。判定帧数决定命中宽容：只有 1 帧判定的招式必须精确，3–5 帧判定的招式好蹭中，但判定过长会让&quot;明明躲开了却被打中&quot;的不公平感冒头。收招是打空惩罚的来源——收招长的重攻打空后会被抓，这正是攻防三角里&quot;进攻被位移克制&quot;的实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判定帧不必连续\">判定帧不必连续</h2><p>一个常被忽略的设计自由度：判定帧不必是连续的一段。同一招可以有多个不连续的激活区间，形成<strong>多段命中</strong>；也可以让不同攻击框在不同帧激活，让判定范围随时间移动。例如一记上挑：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    F1[第1-6帧&lt;br/&gt;起手 抬刀] --&gt; F2[第7-8帧&lt;br/&gt;攻击框A激活&lt;br/&gt;下段横扫]&#10;    F2 --&gt; F3[第9-10帧&lt;br/&gt;攻击框B激活&lt;br/&gt;上段挑击]&#10;    F3 --&gt; F4[第11-22帧&lt;br/&gt;收招 落刀]&#10;    F2 -.命中.-&gt; H1[第一段:轻伤+浅硬直]&#10;    F3 -.命中.-&gt; H2[第二段:浮空+击飞]\">graph TD\n    F1[第1-6帧&lt;br/&gt;起手 抬刀] --&gt; F2[第7-8帧&lt;br/&gt;攻击框A激活&lt;br/&gt;下段横扫]\n    F2 --&gt; F3[第9-10帧&lt;br/&gt;攻击框B激活&lt;br/&gt;上段挑击]\n    F3 --&gt; F4[第11-22帧&lt;br/&gt;收招 落刀]\n    F2 -.命中.-&gt; H1[第一段:轻伤+浅硬直]\n    F3 -.命中.-&gt; H2[第二段:浮空+击飞]</pre><p>这种&quot;框随帧变化&quot;让一记挥砍先横扫近身、再上挑浮空，是浮空连招的起手（launcher）常见做法。多段命中如何避免同一次挥击对同一目标重复结算，是 <a href=\"hit-detection\">命中检测</a> 的去重话题，本篇只强调时序设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"帧优势-命中后谁先能动\">帧优势：命中后谁先能动</h2><p>近战博弈的核心量是<strong>帧优势（frame advantage）</strong>——一次交互结束后，进攻方比防守方早多少帧恢复自由行动。它决定&quot;打完这一下，接下来是我压着你还是你能反击我&quot;。设进攻方从命中那刻起还剩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>atk</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{atk}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">atk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 帧收招，防守方被打入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>def</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{\\text{def}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">def</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 帧受击硬直（命中）或防御硬直（被防御），则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Adv</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>def</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>atk</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Adv} = s_{\\text{def}} - r_{\\text{atk}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Adv</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">def</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">atk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Adv</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Adv} &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Adv</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 称为正优势（plus frames），进攻方先动、可继续压制；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Adv</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Adv} &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Adv</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 称为负优势（minus frames），防守方先动、可反击。举例：一招收招段命中时刻起还剩 6 帧，命中给对方 14 帧硬直，则命中优势 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=14-6=+8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>；同一招被防御只给对方 10 帧防御硬直，则防御优势 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=10-6=+4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>。这套加减法是格斗游戏一切连段与压制的数学基础，也解释了为什么策划调招式时&quot;多给两帧硬直&quot;或&quot;收招快两帧&quot;是牵一发动全身的改动。</p>\n<p>命中硬直（hitstun）本身的产生机制与受击方进入的状态，属于 <a href=\"../practice/enemy-reactions\">敌人受击反应</a>；本篇只把它当作帧优势公式里的输入量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"硬直中的判定帧插入\">硬直中的判定帧插入</h2><p>一个进阶但极重要的时序细节：命中造成的硬直（hitstop，见 <a href=\"../flow/hitstop-feedback\">硬直与打击感</a>）会同时冻结双方几帧，它不改变帧优势——因为双方都被冻结相同帧数——但它会影响判定帧的实际持续时间。若判定帧正好落在硬直期间，攻击框的激活时间会被硬直&quot;拉长&quot;，这可能让本应打一次的招在硬直结束后仍处于激活状态而误判第二次。稳妥的实现是：把攻击框的激活按逻辑帧计，硬直期间冻结逻辑帧推进，使激活区间的&quot;有效帧数&quot;不被硬直改变。这类边界正是判定最容易出隐蔽 bug 的地方，也是为什么帧时序必须显式建模而非依赖动画时长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从帧数据表读一招\">从帧数据表读一招</h2><p>把一招的时序参数集中成一行，是策划与程序沟通的通用语。一张最小可用的近战帧数据表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>招式</th>\n<th>起手</th>\n<th>判定</th>\n<th>收招</th>\n<th>命中硬直</th>\n<th>防御硬直</th>\n<th>命中优势</th>\n<th>防御优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>轻击</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>+5</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中击</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>18</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>+2</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重击</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>-3</td>\n<td>-9</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>读这张表能一眼看出设计意图：轻击正优势、可压制起手，重击负优势、打完有风险，中击介于两者。这张表如何在调参循环里被迭代、如何被遥测数据修正，是 <a href=\"../practice/melee-tuning\">手感调校</a> 的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三段各是独立旋钮：起手管快慢与读招，判定管命中宽容，收招管打空惩罚与连招接续。</li>\n<li>判定帧不必连续，可多段命中或让攻击框随帧移动，是浮空起手与多段招的实现手段。</li>\n<li>帧优势 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Adv</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>def</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>atk</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Adv} = s_{\\text{def}} - r_{\\text{atk}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Adv</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">def</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">atk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定命中后谁先能动，是连段与压制的数学基础。</li>\n<li>硬直冻结双方不改帧优势，但须按逻辑帧计激活区间，避免误判第二次命中。</li>\n<li>一行帧数据（起手/判定/收招/硬直/优势）就是策划与程序的通用语言，读表即读设计意图。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>判定帧上的框如何检测相交、如何去重：<a href=\"hit-detection\">命中检测</a></li>\n<li>帧优势喂给连招：<a href=\"../flow/combo-system\">连招系统</a></li>\n<li>跨库：输入缓冲如何配合起手帧让操作跟手 <a href=\"../../game-input-systems/feel/input-buffering\">输入系统 · 输入缓冲</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"起手/判定/收招帧：近战的时间语法","id":"起手-判定-收招帧-近战的时间语法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三段的设计含义","id":"三段的设计含义"},{"level":2,"text":"判定帧不必连续","id":"判定帧不必连续"},{"level":2,"text":"帧优势：命中后谁先能动","id":"帧优势-命中后谁先能动"},{"level":2,"text":"硬直中的判定帧插入","id":"硬直中的判定帧插入"},{"level":2,"text":"从帧数据表读一招","id":"从帧数据表读一招"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"攻击框与受击框：命中的空间表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-melee-combat-systems/hitreg/hitbox-hurtbox"},"next":{"title":"命中检测：扫掠、多段与优先级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-melee-combat-systems/hitreg/hit-detection"}}